## API Endpoints Used

```
POST {BASE_URL}/sejoli-license/          → Activation
POST {BASE_URL}/sejoli-validate-license/ → Validation
POST {BASE_URL}/sejoli-delete-license/   → Reset
```

**Default BASE_URL**: `https://member.sejoli.co.id` (configurable in [license.service.ts](file:///d:/SIMAK%20PROJECT/src/services/license.service.ts))

